{{- /* internal/render/templates/index.gohtml — the submissions index
(§7.2): one row per submission, ordinal/profile/verdict/assessment/
severity in fixed CSS-grid columns (styling is bead .5's; this file only
supplies structure and class names), never collapsed — same
first-thing-a-reader-needs reasoning as templates/envelope.gohtml, so
never behind a <details> either.

Dot is htmlEnvelopeView (internal/render/html_view_envelope.go); .Submissions
is the per-submission row data. An empty .Submissions — the store has
nothing for this ref, or the ref has zero submissions — renders the
explicit "no submissions found for this ref" empty state instead of a
grid with nothing in it (§12), still inside the same page structure so a
zero-submission run is a well-formed page, not a blank one.

Each row's ordinal doubles as the link into the findings section (§7.2:
the index is what a reader scans first to decide where to go), via
fragmentHref (html_href.go, §8.2-8.3) — the same helper, called the same
way, templates/finding.gohtml already uses for a finding's own permalink.
FindingID is "" for a submission that filed no comments, so that row's
ordinal renders as plain text rather than a link to nowhere. */ -}}
{{define "index"}}
<section id="submissions" class="submissions">
{{if .Submissions}}
<div class="index" role="table">
<div class="index-row index-header" role="row">
<span class="index-cell" role="columnheader">#</span>
<span class="index-cell" role="columnheader">profile</span>
<span class="index-cell" role="columnheader">verdict</span>
<span class="index-cell" role="columnheader">assessment</span>
<span class="index-cell" role="columnheader">severity</span>
</div>
{{range .Submissions}}
<div class="index-row" role="row">
<span class="index-cell index-ordinal" role="cell">{{if .FindingID}}<a href="#{{fragmentHref .FindingID}}">#{{.Ordinal}}</a>{{else}}#{{.Ordinal}}{{end}}</span>
<span class="index-cell index-profile" role="cell">{{.Profile}}</span>
<span class="index-cell index-verdict" role="cell">{{.Verdict}}</span>
<span class="index-cell index-assessment" role="cell">{{.Assessment}}</span>
<span class="index-cell index-severity" role="cell">{{.Severity}}</span>
</div>
{{end}}
</div>
{{else}}
<p class="empty-state">no submissions found for this ref</p>
{{end}}
</section>
{{end}}
